    "identifier": "crippling-strike",
    "description": "<p>You focus your weapons attack on crippling your enemy, to make them far less effective than they are currently. Make a Taijutsu attack based on the weapon used for this jutsu, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 2d10. On a hit, the target must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save they are Weakened.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: You can make an additional attack targeting a different creature in range.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
